    {
      "id": "claim_147d153f25aa4d2397b04163783435f3",
      "statement": "reconcile_findings_with_review_threads is the watch-mode sweep that syncs tracked findings with live GitHub review threads: it backfills GitHub comment/thread identity and marks findings surfaced, records the latest human reply as an interaction flagged for reassessment, and moves a finding to status=resolved / surface_state=resolved once all its GitHub threads are resolved, writing only on change.",
