      "statement": "Reviewer preparation obtains a GitHub App token, prepares a replaceable per-thread sandbox and checkout before the model runs, materializes the appropriate first-review or re-review diff, and injects its per-file/per-side changed-line set so finding creation can validate anchors locally.",
